  <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 2rem;">About Tunnelati</h1>
  <div class="article-body" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
    <p>Tunnelati is an independent, high-signal news site focused exclusively on official developments from The Boring Company.</p>
    <p>We cover primary sources only: the official @boringcompany account on X, relevant posts from Elon Musk that are clearly about TBC / Loop / Prufrock, the official boringcompany.com website and blog, and named public documents (city/county votes, permits) when they represent a real change.</p>
    <p>We skip rumors, valuation gossip, secondary recaps, and speculation unless an official source has stated it.</p>
    <p>This site is automated / AI-assisted and operated by XenMedia Marketing Limited (Peterborough, UK). It is not affiliated with The Boring Company, xAI, Tesla, SpaceX, or Elon Musk.</p>
    <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:info@xenmediamarketing.co.uk">info@xenmediamarketing.co.uk</a></p>
